---
description: Nest related API models through Resource classes, never inline arrays
globs: app/Http/Resources/**/*.php
alwaysApply: false
---

# API Resources

Related models in a Resource `toArray()` must go through another Resource class.

```php
// ❌ BAD — inline related payload
'group' => $this->whenLoaded('group', fn () => $this->group ? [
    'id' => $this->group->id,
    'name' => $this->group->name,
] : null),

// ✅ GOOD
'group' => GroupResource::make($this->whenLoaded('group')),
'companies' => CompanyResource::collection($this->whenLoaded('companies')),
```

If the full Resource is too large for an embed, add a `*SummaryResource` and use that. Do not invent ad-hoc arrays in the parent Resource.
